<div class="txtlevel"><p>Proiect de testare pentru studentii din grupa 236.</p></div>
 <br/><a name='toc_1'></a>
<h1 class='doclevel'>1.Test Suite : pbir3611_BBT</h1>
<div><p>se testeaza adaugarea produsului</p>
</div><a name="toc_tc28822"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P236-21: AdaugareProdusECPValidTestCase&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">pbir3611</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Se verifica&nbsp;adaugarea cu succes a unui produs nou atunci cand datele de intrare apartin clasei de echivalenta&nbsp;valide. Clase de echivalenta&nbsp;validate:</p>

<p>- nume produs valid nevid</p>

<p>- pret&nbsp;valid pozitiv</p>

<p>- categorie valida&nbsp;existenta</p>

<p>- tip valid existent</p>

<p>Rezultatul asteptat este salvarea produsului in sistem, persistarea lui in fisierul CSV si afisarea in lista produselor active.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>- exista&nbsp;cel putin o categorie valida&nbsp;in sistem</p>

<p>- exista&nbsp;cel putin un tip valid in sistem</p>

<p>- fisierul CSV de produse este accesibil</p>

<p>- numele produsului este valid si nevid</p>

<p>- pretul produsului este un numar pozitiv</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > name of the autotest class:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > name of the test method:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">pbir3611_F01:  Adaugare Produs [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br/></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<a name="toc_tc28824"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P236-22: AdaugareProdusECPInvalidTestCase&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">pbir3611</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Se verifica&nbsp;faptul ca&nbsp;sistemul respinge adaugarea unui produs nou atunci cand datele de intrare apartin unei clase de echivalenta&nbsp;nevalide. Clase de echivalenta&nbsp;nevalidate:</p>

<p>- nume produs invalid (sir vid)</p>

<p>- pret&nbsp;valid pozitiv</p>

<p>- categorie valida&nbsp;existenta</p>

<p>- tip valid existent</p>

<p>Rezultatul asteptat este ca&nbsp;produsul nu este salvat in sistem si&nbsp;nu este persistat in fisierul CSV.&nbsp;</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>- exista&nbsp;cel putin o categorie valida&nbsp;in sistem</p>

<p>- exista&nbsp;cel putin un tip valid in sistem</p>

<p>- fisierul CSV de produse este accesibil</p>

<p>- numele produsului este invalid (gol)</p>

<p>- pretul produsului este valid si pozitiv</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > name of the autotest class:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > name of the test method:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">pbir3611_F01:  Adaugare Produs [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br/></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<a name="toc_tc28826"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P236-23: AdaugareProdusBVAValidTestCase&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">pbir3611</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Se verifica&nbsp;adaugarea cu succes a unui produs nou folosind analiza valorilor limita&nbsp;pentru atributul pret.</p>

<p>Valoarea de test apartine clasei valide de la limita:</p>

<p>- nume produs valid nevid</p>

<p>- pret&nbsp;valid la limita inferioara&nbsp;acceptata</p>

<p>- categorie valida&nbsp;existenta</p>

<p>- tip valid existenta</p>

<p>Rezultatul asteptat este salvarea corecta&nbsp;a produsului in sistem si&nbsp;persistarea lui in fisierul CSV.</p>
</td></tr><tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Preconditions:</span><br /><p>- exista&nbsp;cel putin o categorie valida&nbsp;in sistem</p>

<p>- exista&nbsp;cel putin un tip valid in sistem</p>

<p>- fisierul CSV de produse este accesibil</p>

<p>- numele produsului este valid si nevid</p>

<p>- pretul produsului este la limita inferioara&nbsp;valida</p>
</td></tr><tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Execution type:</span></td><td colspan="3">Manual</td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Estimated exec. duration (min):</span></td><td colspan="3"></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Importance:</span></td><td colspan="3">Medium</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"></td></tr><tr><td > name of the autotest class:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td > name of the test method:</td><td  colspan = "3" ></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Requirements</span><td colspan="3">pbir3611_F01:  Adaugare Produs [Version : 1]<br /></td></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Keywords:</span></td><td colspan="3">&nbsp;None<br/></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<a name="toc_tc28828"></a><p>&nbsp;</p><div> <table class="tc" width="90%" ><tr><th colspan="4">Test Case P236-24: AdaugareProdusBVAInvalidTestCase&nbsp;<span style="font-size: 80%;">[Version  : 1]</span></th></tr>
<tr><td width="20%" valign="top"><span class="label">Author:</span></td><td colspan="3">pbir3611</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="4"><span class="label">Summary:</span><br /><p>Se verifica&nbsp;faptul ca&nbsp;sistemul respinge adaugarea unui produs nou folosind analiza valorilor limita&nbsp;pentru atributul pret. Valoarea de test aparyine clasei nevalide de la limita:</p>

<p>- nume produs valid nevid</p>

<p>- pret&nbsp;invalid la limita inferioara&nbsp;neacceptata</p>

